{"parentUuid":"90a52c35-d14b-4570-82d0-622bd0475902","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a4806b66a0f38959f","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChU1hqgiQSuUzLxXmDs9F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found no bugs in PR #2764.\n\nThe PR makes two changes to `.github/workflows/ci.yml`:\n\n- **Secret-scan range:** when a run has no previous commit on record (a new branch, a scheduled run or a manual run), `logopts` used to be a bare `-1`. It is now `-1 ${PUSH_AFTER}`. That looked risky at first, because scheduled runs have no \"after\" commit, which would leave `-1` on its own again. But line 292 sets `PUSH_AFTER` to `${{ github.sha }}`, which every event type has, so this is correct.\n- **E2E timeout:** the browser test job now gets 60 minutes on scheduled and manual runs and keeps 25 minutes otherwise. The `cond && 60 || 25` expression evaluates correctly.\n\nI did not post any comments to the PR, since there were no findings. The GitHub inline-comment connection also failed to start (its token has expired), so posting would have needed `gh api`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":557,"cache_read_input_tokens":66467,"output_tokens":357,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":31},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":557},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d113887d-b8df-422d-a6f6-3801457f5c81","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011ChU1hqYHT8Asv6A4SLusA","requestRef":"ab239632-c138-47b2-885c-f092ad003a2c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"5m","attributionSkill":"code-review","type":"assistant","uuid":"853daf4d-4540